<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-535] &quot;Scheduler already terminated&quot; occurs when RemoteInterpreter.close() doesn&apos;t succeed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-535</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If there&apos;re some issue for remote interpreter to not respond properly (e.g. OOME), restarting interpreter shutdowns remote scheduler but doesn&apos;t shutdown remote interpreter process because reference count doesn&apos;t reach 0.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can refer summarized logs from here - &lt;a href=&quot;https://gist.github.com/HeartSaVioR/26190a71df6815aa62b8&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://gist.github.com/HeartSaVioR/26190a71df6815aa62b8&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
