                            <comment id="15072310" author="kabhwan" created="Mon, 28 Dec 2015 01:13:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Another log : zeppelin spark interpreter process has crashed&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gist.github.com/HeartSaVioR/d5049e7464534c48b4bf&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://gist.github.com/HeartSaVioR/d5049e7464534c48b4bf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After interpreter has crashed, any job requests were failed with broken pipe. But differ than this, I can restart interpreter via UI since watchdog takes care of killed process and flag terminate to true, so RemoteInterpreter.setInterpreterGroup() can go on.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
